The goal is to design and implement a Shopify App that enables store owners or app users to easily create, configure, and manage custom pop-ups for their Shopify storefronts.

 These pop-ups can serve multiple use cases including: 
1. Promotional pop-ups (Nth visit, season-based, time-based) 
2. User onboarding pop-ups (sign-up, social media follow)
3. Data input or profile collection forms
4.  Referral and credit info pop-ups 
5. Gamification or interactive event-based pop-ups 
6. App download prompts 
7. Collection or page redirection pop-ups 
8. FTUE tutorial or guidance 
9. Cookie consent and preferences 
10. Product comparison
11. Quick filters Inventory, price, and discount alerts 
12. Product highlights, urgency, and social proof 
13. Exit intent, cart abandonment, and discount timer pop-ups 
14. Out-of-stock alerts, cart confirmation, and cross-sell suggestions 
15. Payment gateway authorization or confirmation pop-ups 

The app should be compatible with Online Store 2.0 themes and render via theme app extensions or injected scripts. 

All subsequent instructions will define the requirements to be captured in the PRD to be generated

