ALL POSSIBLE FEATURES 
Display Triggers
	 - Session Based Triggers 
	- Source based Trigger 
	- Referral Source (Ad Campaign- meta , Google, UTM), Organic, Direct, 
	- Referral - Landing page - Page Type Based: HP, PLP, PDP - 
	- URL Based: specific Collection, specific Product 
	- Platform Type Based: Desktop, mweb, App 
