	- Saved Cookie preferences - Visit Time Based (Peak shopping hours, time of day, sale campaigns, day of week, season or holiday period) 
	- Page Visit Based (based on user current data storage events - current url, previous url, product view, category browse, preferences and user historical data, page type (covering all website pages)) 
- User action based triggers (scroll depth %, mouse hover/ long press, mouse idle for X time, add to cart, remove from cart, wishlist, product view, filter or sort, size chart, mini pdp view,variant selection, search bar focus, review section interaction, form field, form exit, webiste exit, checkout exit) 
- Cart based triggers (cart amount, basket size threshold, cart items inventory, discount availability, payment method selection, shipping cost)
 - User Cohort Based Triggers 
	- User history
	 - User geolocation 
	- Cookie Preference 
	- Time Based Triggers (Seconds after page load, time on website, time inactive, X seconds after dismissal of last pop up) 
- Product Based Triggers (inventory, previously purchased items, belonging to certain attribute/ category/ discount bucket) 
- Pop up impression based triggers and series triggers 

Dismissal - Time Based Dismissal Trigger - X second after display, countdown timer completion - User action based - Click Based (Click on close button, click outside modal, click on specific element) and Keyboard based (Exc key, enter/return key, any key) - Navigation based - Page Change, navigation to specific URL - State Change - Profile updated, product added (to order, cart, wishlist), product successfully removed (cart, wishlist), promo code (successfully applied, or copied), successful login - Page Based trigger - Page refresh, scroll to specific locaiton on page, scroll past pop-up 

TYPES: Permanent Dismissal (session and user based, utm based) and Temporary Dismissal (collapse into preview, re-appearance trigger) 
Animation - Entrance, exit, user action based (microanimations, transfer animations), time based Gestures - Swipe (up/down/top/bottom) - Double Tap / Double Click - Click (within the modal button, outside the modal) - pinch in / pinch out - long press 

Pop-up Placement - w.r.t viewport - w.r.t page - w.r.t preview 

